TITLE:: SCVisuals
summary:: Main namespace and facade for real-time audio visualization in SuperCollider
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/SCVTheme, Classes/SCVMeasurementBroker, Classes/SCVLevelsSource

DESCRIPTION::
SCVisuals is a cohesive, configurable, lightweight suite of real-time audio analysis visualizers for SuperCollider.
It prioritizes audio-thread safety, predictable resource lifecycles, and modern, compact visual aesthetics without altering the core SuperCollider installation or introducing foreign C++ GUI dependencies.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: version
Returns the current SCVisuals version string.

METHOD:: broker
Returns the default singleton link::Classes/SCVMeasurementBroker:: instance.

METHOD:: theme
Returns the current active link::Classes/SCVTheme::.

METHOD:: theme
Sets the current active link::Classes/SCVTheme:: by name or instance.

METHOD:: themes
Returns the dictionary of all registered themes.

METHOD:: sources
Returns the dictionary of all active measurement sources managed by the broker.

METHOD:: freeAll
Frees all active measurement sources, osc responders, and subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
// Inspect version and active theme
SCVisuals.version.postln;
SCVisuals.theme.postln;

// Switch theme
SCVisuals.theme = \phosphor;
SCVisuals.theme = \graphite;
::
